<title>USA: Automatic Data Processing names new CFO.</title>
<headline>Automatic Data Processing names new CFO.</headline>
<dateline>ROSELAND, N.J. 1997-08-19</dateline>
<text>
<p>Automatic Data Processing Inc said Tuesday it has named Richard Haviland chief financial officer.</p>
<p>Haviland will continue as vice president of finance, the company said.</p>
<p>Haviland fills a vacancy created by the departure of Fred Anderson Jr, who resigned as chief financial officer in March 1996, the company said.</p>
</text>
